    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels different this time. like there's no coming back from this. if i try to \"take it one moment at a time\" i'm just dragging out the humiliation. every day is just another day of people looking at me with that pitying look, knowing i'm the guy who lost everything. it feels like the only thing i have left to control is how this much mess is actually seen. it's so exhausting trying to pretend there's a way up from here.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
