      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Even when the visible identity feels gone, the core of who you are still exists beneath the wreckage. Dignity isn't found in a public performance or what others think of your status; it resides in how you treat yourself during this extreme vulnerability. Consider that the current version of you, the one experiencing this pain, is resilient and capable of changing your definition of success entirely. Reach out to a mental health professional who can help you navigate this profound identity crisis with compassion.",
